      "id": "2083615478115958784",
      "title": "Stop Wasting Sol: The Codex Configuration That Makes GPT-5.6 Luna Matter ",
      "preview_text": "The expensive mistake is not choosing the wrong model. It is sending every task to the strongest one before you have classified the work.\nCodex now gives you three GPT-5.6 lanes: Luna, Terra, and Sol.",
      "cover_media": {
        "id": "QXBpTWVkaWE6DAAFCgABHOp97CobcAAKAAIUucf+jZVAAwAA",
        "media_id": "2083616230884470784",
        "media_info": {
          "__typename": "ApiImage",
          "color_info": {
            "palette": [
              {
                "percentage": 54.96,
